        "observations": {
          "desktop_closed": "Birch-marked body, exposed finger joints, cream lid, blue lake with three sage forms, green seam, brass fittings and gray rounded feet are all readable.",
          "desktop_open": "Pale inner lid and empty cavity sit above the green rim; dark hinge clearance makes mechanical continuity ambiguous, not demonstrably broken.",
          "marketing": "Same blue pond and three sage forms, birch finger-jointed body, green seam, brass caps/clasp/round disk/ring and speckled pebble feet; more organic grain and softer shading.",
          "mobile_closed": "Closed lid and clasp are aligned; full object and controls fit. Birch texture and corner joints become blockier at this scale.",
          "mobile_open": "Full lid, tab and feet fit. Fine parallel banding on the inner surfaces and stepped green-rim joints are conspicuous."
        },
